From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:23:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 250/260] [ae-patch] Show a Compact card above the composer and
 in the rail past the Suggest compacting at size

The server sweep labels a long Claude chat ae.handoff=suggest. The action dock
gets a context card (ranked after the usage limit) with Compact and Not now,
the rail's Context section shows the same line and drops its own Compact button
while the card shows, and CompactButton moves to a file of its own. Compact
posts the compact event for the open chat, then snoozes the suggestion; both
buttons go quiet while the chat runs. The Hand off at setting is renamed
Suggest compacting at, with a new hint.
